# All env vars live in Vercel. Pull them locally — do not commit .env files.
#
#   cd apps/web && vercel link && pnpm env:pull
#
# Schema: src/env.ts  |  Remote keys: vercel env ls
#
# Vercel "Development" should include at least:
#   DATABASE_URL=postgres://postgres:postgres@127.0.0.1:5433/mbqb
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_SERVER_URL=http://localhost:3000
#   PAYLOAD_SECRET, PREVIEW_SECRET, BLOB_READ_WRITE_TOKEN (as needed)
#
# Production DB scripts: pnpm env:pull:production → .env.production.local
